    'Data and privacy' => '数据与隐私',
    'What is BrickAtlas?' => 'BrickAtlas 是什么？',
    'BrickAtlas is a price tracker and discovery tool for LEGO® fans. We pull data from the LEGO catalog, match it against current store offers, and help you find deals, track sets, and explore the catalog by theme, interest or budget.' => 'BrickAtlas 是为乐高®粉丝打造的价格追踪和套装发现工具。我们从乐高目录获取数据，与各商店的当前报价进行比对，帮助你寻找优惠、追踪套装，并按主题、兴趣或预算浏览目录。',
    'Are you affiliated with The LEGO Group?' => '你们与乐高集团有关联吗？',
    'No. BrickAtlas is an independent project, not sponsored, authorized or endorsed by The LEGO Group. LEGO® is a trademark of the LEGO Group.' => '没有。BrickAtlas 是一个独立项目，未获得乐高集团的赞助、授权或认可。LEGO®是乐高集团的商标。',
    'Is BrickAtlas free to use?' => 'BrickAtlas 免费吗？',
    'Yes. The catalog, prices, wishlist and ratings are all free. We may earn a commission from some store links (see Data and privacy).' => '是的。目录、价格、愿望清单和评价都是免费的。我们可能会从部分商店链接获得佣金（参见数据与隐私）。',
    'Which languages does BrickAtlas support?' => 'BrickAtlas 支持哪些语言？',
    'The interface is available in English, Polish, German, French, Spanish, Italian, Japanese and Chinese. You can switch languages from the flag selector in the top bar.' => '界面提供英语、波兰语、德语、法语、西班牙语、意大利语、日语和中文。你可以通过顶部栏的国旗切换语言。',
    'Where do you get prices from?' => '价格从哪里来？',
    'The catalog price comes from LEGO itself. Offers from other stores are pulled from the stores we track and refreshed regularly. Every offer card links straight to the store.' => '目录价格来自乐高官方。其他商店的报价来自我们追踪的商店，并定期更新。每条报价都直接链接到商店。',
    'How often are prices updated?' => '价格多久更新一次？',
    'Most offers are refreshed at least once a day. Highly volatile stores (marketplaces, flash sales) are checked more often. The catalog price from LEGO is updated whenever it changes.' => '大多数报价至少每天更新一次。价格波动大的商店（电商平台、限时抢购）检查得更频繁。乐高目录价格一有变化就会更新。',
    'Why does the price in a store differ from what BrickAtlas shows?' => '为什么商店里的价格和 BrickAtlas 显示的不一样？',
    'Stores adjust prices between our refreshes, run hidden coupons or charge regional pricing. The link on every offer takes you straight to the live listing, so you can verify the current price before buying.' => '商店会在我们两次更新之间调整价格，或提供隐藏优惠券和地区定价。每条报价都直接链接到商店的商品页面，方便你在购买前确认当前价格。',
    'What does "On Sale" mean?' => '“特价”是什么意思？',
    'What is the "Best offer" label on a set page?' => '套装页面上的“最佳报价”标签是什么？',
    '"Best offer" is the cheapest store offer we currently track for that set in USD. We pick the lowest price, then break ties using store rating and review count.' => '“最佳报价”是我们目前追踪到的该套装最便宜的美元报价。我们选取最低价，价格相同时按商店评分和评价数决定。',
    'Do offer prices include shipping?' => '报价包含运费吗？',
    'How do I create an account?' => '如何创建账户？',
    'How do I reset my password?' => '如何重置密码？',
    'On the sign-in page click "Forgot password?", enter the email you registered with, and we\'ll send a reset link. The link expires after a short window for security reasons.' => '在登录页面点击“忘记密码？”，输入注册时使用的邮箱，我们会发送重置链接。出于安全考虑，链接会在短时间后失效。',
    'How do I change the interface language?' => '如何更改界面语言？',
    'How do I add a set to my wishlist?' => '如何把套装加入愿望清单？',
    'Hover any set card and tap the heart icon, or open the set page and use the heart button. You need to be signed in. The full list lives in "My wishlist" in the user menu.' => '将鼠标悬停在套装卡片上并点击爱心，或打开套装页面使用爱心按钮。需要先登录。完整清单在用户菜单的“我的愿望清单”中。',
    'How do I mark a set as owned?' => '如何把套装标记为已拥有？',
    'Tap the box icon on any set card or on the set page. Owned sets are saved to "My owned sets" and feed your collection stats on the homepage.' => '点击套装卡片或套装页面上的盒子图标。已拥有的套装会保存在“我的套装”中，并计入首页的收藏统计。',
    'Can I hide sets I already own from the catalog?' => '可以在目录中隐藏我已拥有的套装吗？',
    'Is my wishlist visible to other users?' => '其他用户能看到我的愿望清单吗？',
    'How do I review a set?' => '如何评价套装？',
    'Open the set page, scroll to "Reviews" and click "Rate this set". Choose Quick rating (one score + optional note) or Detailed review (6 dimensions). You can switch between modes any time.' => '打开套装页面，滚动到“评价”，点击“评价此套装”。可选择快速评分（一个分数加可选点评）或详细评价（6 个方面），随时可以切换。',
    'What\'s the difference between Quick and Detailed reviews?' => '快速评分和详细评价有什么区别？',
    'What is my reviewer profile?' => '什么是评价者档案？',
    'After a few detailed reviews we build a profile that shows what you tend to value (display vs play, minifigures vs piece count, etc.) and whether you rate higher or lower than the community on each dimension.' => '写过几条详细评价后，我们会生成一份档案，展示你看重什么（展示还是玩、人仔还是颗粒数等），以及你在各方面的评分比社区高还是低。',
    'Can I edit or delete my review?' => '可以编辑或删除我的评价吗？',
    'Yes. Open the set page or go to "My reviews" in your profile. Each review has Edit and Delete actions.' => '可以。打开套装页面或进入个人资料中的“我的评价”，每条评价都可以编辑和删除。',
    'What data do you collect about me?' => '你们收集我的哪些数据？',
    'Only what we need to run the service: your username, email, hashed password, language preference, and the sets you save to your wishlist, owned list or reviews. We don\'t sell this data.' => '只收集运营服务所需的数据：用户名、邮箱、加密后的密码、语言偏好，以及你加入愿望清单、收藏或评价的套装。我们不会出售这些数据。',
    'What are affiliate links?' => '什么是联盟链接？',
    'Where does the set data come from?' => '套装数据从哪里来？',
    'Set, parts, minifigure and theme data come from the LEGO catalog and community databases (notably Rebrickable). We refresh regularly so new releases show up quickly.' => '套装、零件、人仔和主题数据来自乐高目录和社区数据库（主要是 Rebrickable）。我们会定期更新，让新品尽快上线。',
    'Do you use cookies?' => '你们使用 Cookie 吗？',
    'Browse LEGO sets currently on sale across major retailers. Track price drops, exclusive promotions and the deepest discounts on BrickAtlas.' => '各大零售商当前特价的乐高套装。在 BrickAtlas 上关注降价、独家促销和最大折扣。',
    'Browse LEGO sets approaching their official retirement date. Catch sets before they leave shelves and resale prices climb on the aftermarket.' => '即将到达官方停产日期的乐高套装。在它们下架、二手价格上涨之前入手。',
    'Browse the LEGO sets catalog and filter by theme, subtheme, release year or piece count. Compare prices across major retailers on BrickAtlas.' => '浏览乐高套装目录，按主题、子主题、上市年份或颗粒数筛选。在 BrickAtlas 上比较各大零售商的价格。',
    ' Track price drops on BrickAtlas.' => ' 在 BrickAtlas 上关注降价。',
    'Browse LEGO sets featuring minifigure {name} ({number}). Compare offers and track every appearance of this character on BrickAtlas.' => '含人仔{name}（{number}）的乐高套装。比较报价，在 BrickAtlas 上找到这个角色出现过的每个套装。',
    'BrickAtlas is a free LEGO price tracker. We pull catalog data and match it against current retailer offers so you can spot real deals on sets.' => 'BrickAtlas 是免费的乐高比价工具。我们将目录数据与零售商的当前报价进行比对，帮助你发现真正的优惠。',
    'Sign in to BrickAtlas to access your LEGO wishlist, your reviews and your collection.' => '登录 BrickAtlas，查看你的乐高愿望清单、评价和收藏。',
    'Create a free BrickAtlas account to track LEGO sets, build a wishlist and write reviews.' => '创建免费的 BrickAtlas 账户，追踪乐高套装、建立愿望清单并撰写评价。',
    'LEGO Sets for Toddlers - Ages 1 to 4 on BrickAtlas' => '幼儿乐高套装 - 1 至 4 岁 | BrickAtlas',
    'LEGO Sets for Kids - Ages 5 to 8 on BrickAtlas' => '儿童乐高套装 - 5 至 8 岁 | BrickAtlas',
    'LEGO Sets for Tweens - Ages 9 to 12 on BrickAtlas' => '大龄儿童乐高套装 - 9 至 12 岁 | BrickAtlas',
    'LEGO Sets for Teens - Ages 13 and Up on BrickAtlas' => '青少年乐高套装 - 13 岁及以上 | BrickAtlas',
    'LEGO Sets for Adults - 18+ Builder Collection on BrickAtlas' => '成人乐高套装 - 18+ 系列 | BrickAtlas',
    'Small LEGO Builds - Sets Under 200 Pieces on BrickAtlas' => '小型乐高套装 - 少于 200 颗粒 | BrickAtlas',
    'Big LEGO Builds - Sets with 2000+ Pieces on BrickAtlas' => '大型乐高套装 - 2000 颗粒以上 | BrickAtlas',
    'Browse LEGO Duplo sets and toddler-safe builds for ages 1 to 4. Compare prices, find big-piece sets and sensory toys on BrickAtlas.' => '适合 1 至 4 岁的乐高得宝和幼儿套装。在 BrickAtlas 上比较价格，寻找大颗粒套装。',
    'Browse LEGO sets for kids aged 5 to 8. Compare prices and find approachable builds, fan-favourite themes and great gift ideas on BrickAtlas.' => '适合 5 至 8 岁儿童的乐高套装。在 BrickAtlas 上比较价格，寻找易上手的模型、热门主题和礼物灵感。',
    'Browse LEGO sets for teens aged 13 and up. Compare prices and find advanced builds, display models and complex sets on BrickAtlas.' => '适合 13 岁及以上青少年的乐高套装。在 BrickAtlas 上比较价格，寻找进阶模型和展示模型。',
    'Browse the LEGO 18+ adult collection on BrickAtlas. Compare prices on Icons, Architecture, Botanical Collection and other display-grade sets.' => 'BrickAtlas 上的乐高 18+ 成人系列。比较 Icons、建筑、植物收藏等展示级套装的价格。',
    'Browse LEGO sets with fewer than 200 pieces. Compare prices on polybags, mini-builds and quick gift ideas across major retailers on BrickAtlas.' => '少于 200 颗粒的乐高套装。在 BrickAtlas 上比较拼砌包、迷你模型和小礼物的价格。',
    'Browse LEGO sets with 2000+ pieces. Compare prices on UCS Star Wars, Modular Buildings, Technic flagships and other massive builds on BrickAtlas.' => '2000 颗粒以上的乐高套装。在 BrickAtlas 上比较 UCS 星球大战、街景建筑、机械组旗舰等大型套装的价格。',
    'LEGO sets for toddlers' => '幼儿乐高套装',
    'LEGO sets for kids' => '儿童乐高套装',
    'LEGO sets for tweens' => '大龄儿童乐高套装',
    'LEGO sets for teens' => '青少年乐高套装',
    'LEGO sets for adults' => '成人乐高套装',
