    'For Tweens (9–12)' => '适合大龄儿童（9–12）',
    'Bigger, more detailed builds for ages 9 to 12.' => '适合 9 至 12 岁的更大、更精细的模型。',
    'Small Builds' => '小型套装',
    'Big Builds' => '大型套装',
    'Multi-day, multi-thousand-piece projects for serious builders.' => '需要拼好几天、颗粒数上千的大型项目，适合资深拼搭者。',
    'Compare prices for {name}' => '比较{name}的价格',
    '{name} ({number}) - LEGO Set Prices | BrickAtlas' => '{name}（{number}）- 乐高套装价格 | BrickAtlas',
    'BrickAtlas - LEGO catalog updates' => 'BrickAtlas - 乐高目录更新',
    'Latest catalog activity on BrickAtlas: new sets, fresh store offers, published PDF instructions and sets approaching retirement.' => 'BrickAtlas 目录最新动态：新套装、新报价、已发布的 PDF 说明书以及即将停产的套装。',
    'New set: {number} {name}' => '新套装：{number} {name}',
    'New offer: {number} {name}' => '新报价：{number} {name}',
    'New offer for {name} ({number}): {price} at {store}.' => '{name}（{number}）的新报价：{store} {price}。',
    'a store' => '一家商店',
    'New PDF instruction: {number} {name}' => '新的 PDF 说明书：{number} {name}',
    'Building instruction PDF published for {name} ({number}).' => '{name}（{number}）的 PDF 拼搭说明书已发布。',
    'Retiring soon: {number} {name}' => '即将停产：{number} {name}',
    '{name} ({number}) is scheduled to retire on {date}.' => '{name}（{number}）预计于 {date} 停产。',
    'Theme: {theme}' => '主题：{theme}',
    'Released {year}' => '{year} 年上市',
    'New LEGO set added to the catalog: {name} ({number}).' => '目录新增乐高套装：{name}（{number}）。',
    'New PDF instructions ({n}): {number} {name}' => '新的 PDF 说明书（{n}）：{number} {name}',
    '{n} building instruction PDFs available for {name} ({number}).' => '{name}（{number}）有 {n} 份 PDF 拼搭说明书。',
    'Instruction {n}' => '说明书 {n}',
    'View on BrickAtlas' => '在 BrickAtlas 上查看',
    'View set on BrickAtlas' => '在 BrickAtlas 上查看套装',
    'Go to offer' => '前往报价',
    'Retirement date: {date}' => '停产日期：{date}',
    'catalog updates (Atom)' => '目录更新（Atom）',
    'catalog updates (JSON Feed)' => '目录更新（JSON Feed）',
    'catalog updates (RSS)' => '目录更新（RSS）',
    'Not out yet' => '尚未上市',
    'Launches on {date}' => '{date} 上市',
    '{n, plural, =0{out today} =1{day until launch} other{days until launch}}' => '{n, plural, =0{今天上市} =1{天后上市} other{天后上市}}',
    'Retiring soon' => '即将停产',
    'Retires on {date}' => '{date} 停产',
    '{n, plural, =0{retires today} =1{day until retirement} other{days until retirement}}' => '{n, plural, =0{今天停产} =1{天后停产} other{天后停产}}',
    '{n, plural, =1{# month of production} other{# months of production}}' => '{n, plural, =1{生产 # 个月} other{生产 # 个月}}',
    'Some store links on offer cards are affiliate links. When you buy through one, we may earn a small commission and you pay the same price. That is how we keep BrickAtlas free.' => '报价卡片上的部分商店链接是联盟链接。你通过这些链接购买时，我们可能获得少量佣金，你支付的价格不变。这让 BrickAtlas 得以保持免费。',
    'Thanks for your message. We\'ll get back to you soon.' => '感谢你的留言，我们会尽快回复。',
    'Thanks for signing up. Check your inbox for a verification email. The link is valid for {hours} hours.' => '感谢注册。请查收验证邮件，链接在 {hours} 小时内有效。',
    'I own this set: add it to my collection' => '我拥有这个套装：加入我的收藏',
    'What this particular set is for you. You might buy one set for display and another for play, so we save these answers separately for each set.' => '这个套装对你来说是做什么用的。你可能买一个套装用来展示，另一个用来玩，所以我们为每个套装单独保存这些回答。',
    'No reviews yet. Be the first!' => '还没有评价，来做第一个吧！',
    'A homepage built around your collection: themes, new arrivals and price drops, updated along with the catalog.' => '围绕你的收藏打造的首页：主题、新品和降价，随目录一起更新。',
    'A few quick questions about budget, age and theme, and we\'ll match sets for you.' => '回答几个关于预算、年龄和主题的简单问题，我们为你挑选合适的套装。',
    'Small bonus builds that come with collectible LEGO magazines: minifigure packs, vehicles and seasonal scenes from newsstand issues.' => '随乐高收藏杂志附赠的小模型：人仔、交通工具和报亭版季节场景。',
    'Sets sold only through official LEGO channels. They are usually larger collector releases and sell out fast.' => '只通过乐高官方渠道销售的套装，通常是很快售罄的大型收藏套装。',
    'Sets with a confirmed retirement date. Once they leave stores, prices usually go up.' => '已确认停产日期的套装。一旦下架，价格通常会上涨。',
    'Snowy builds, holiday scenes and sets that make good gifts.' => '雪景模型、节日场景和适合送礼的套装。',
    'Search (try "AFOL" or "sealed box")' => '搜索（例如“AFOL”或“未拆封”）',
    'A change to an official set, such as added details, a bigger baseplate or remixed parts.' => '对官方套装的改造，例如增加细节、扩大底板或重新组合零件。',
    'The smaller cousin of BURP: a one-piece rock mold for compact scenes.' => 'BURP 的小号版本：适合小场景的一体成型岩石零件。',
    'Praise for using a part in a clever, unexpected way, like a wrench as a moustache or a flame as a fish tail.' => '称赞以巧妙、意想不到的方式使用零件，例如把扳手当胡子、把火焰当鱼尾。',
    'An online LEGO marketplace and inventory tool, smaller than BrickLink.' => '规模比 BrickLink 小的乐高在线交易市场和库存管理工具。',
    'Tag for a MOC that is still being built or refined. Feedback welcome.' => '用于仍在拼搭或打磨中的 MOC 的标签，欢迎反馈。',
    'LEGO sets grouped by interest: Adults Welcome, Star Wars, Magazines, Polybags, Exclusive, Harry Potter and more.' => '按兴趣分组的乐高套装：成人专区、星球大战、杂志、拼砌包、独家、哈利·波特等。',
    'Shortcuts into the catalog. Pick what you\'re into and we\'ll show matching sets.' => '通往目录的快捷入口。选择你感兴趣的内容，我们会展示相应的套装。',
    'Heartlake City sets: cafés, pets and friendship stories.' => '心湖城套装：咖啡馆、宠物和友谊故事。',
    'Quick answers about prices, your wishlist, reviews and your account. Type a keyword to filter or browse by topic.' => '关于价格、愿望清单、评价和账户的快速解答。输入关键词或按主题浏览。',
    'Search the FAQ (try "wishlist", "price" or "password")' => '搜索常见问题（例如“愿望清单”“价格”或“密码”）',
    '"On Sale" lists sets where the lowest store offer we found is below the official LEGO price. The biggest discounts are at the top.' => '“特价”列出我们找到的最低商店报价低于乐高官方价格的套装，折扣最大的排在最前面。',
    'No. The price shown is the item price listed by the store. Shipping, taxes and coupons are calculated at the store\'s checkout, so check the final price before you order.' => '不包含。显示的是商店列出的商品价格。运费、税费和优惠券在商店结算时计算，下单前请确认最终价格。',
    'Click "Register" in the top bar, fill in your username, email and password, and submit. We\'ll email you a link that is valid for 24 hours. Click it to activate your account.' => '点击顶部栏的“注册”，填写用户名、邮箱和密码并提交。我们会发送一个 24 小时内有效的链接，点击即可激活账户。',
    'I didn\'t receive the verification email. What now?' => '我没有收到验证邮件，怎么办？',
    'Check your spam folder first. If it\'s not there, use the "Resend verification" link on the sign-in page and we\'ll send a new link to the same address.' => '请先检查垃圾邮件文件夹。如果没有，请使用登录页面的“重新发送验证”链接，我们会向同一地址发送新的链接。',
    'Use the flag selector in the top bar to switch languages on any page. If you\'re signed in, you can also save a preferred language in Settings and we\'ll use it on all your devices.' => '在任意页面都可以通过顶部栏的国旗切换语言。登录后，你还可以在设置中保存首选语言，我们会在你的所有设备上使用。',
    'Yes. Turn on "Hide sets I already own" in Settings. Sets you marked as owned will no longer appear in the main catalog, search or new arrivals.' => '可以。在设置中开启“隐藏我已拥有的套装”，标记为已拥有的套装将不再出现在目录、搜索和新品中。',
    'No. Your wishlist and owned sets are private. We use them only for your personal homepage and recommendations.' => '不能。你的愿望清单和已拥有的套装是私密的，只用于你的个人首页和推荐。',
    'Quick rating is one overall score (0–10) plus an optional one-line note, about 30 seconds. Detailed reviews score 6 dimensions (Look, Build, Features, Quality, Value, Overall) and feed the radar chart on the set page.' => '快速评分是一个总分（0–10）加一句可选的简短点评，约 30 秒。详细评价对 6 个方面（外观、拼搭、功能、品质、性价比、总体）打分，并用于套装页面的雷达图。',
    'Yes. We use cookies for sign-in sessions, your language preference, analytics (Google Analytics) and ads (Google AdSense). Details are in our Privacy Policy.' => '是的。我们在登录、语言偏好、统计分析（Google Analytics）和广告（Google AdSense）中使用 Cookie。详情请见我们的隐私政策。',
    'Browse LEGO sets, compare prices across retailers, explore themes and see which sets a minifigure appears in. BrickAtlas is a free LEGO price tracker.' => '浏览乐高套装，比较各零售商的价格，探索主题，查看某个人仔出现在哪些套装中。BrickAtlas 是免费的乐高比价工具。',
    'Plain-language definitions of LEGO acronyms and AFOL slang: AFOL, MOC, SNOT, UCS, MISB and dozens more. A reference for collectors.' => '通俗易懂地解释乐高缩写和 AFOL 行话：AFOL、MOC、SNOT、UCS、MISB 等数十个词。收藏者的速查表。',
    'Answers to common questions about BrickAtlas: how price tracking works, your wishlist, reviews, accounts and privacy.' => '关于 BrickAtlas 的常见问题解答：比价如何运作、愿望清单、评价、账户和隐私。',
    'Get in touch with BrickAtlas. Send us questions, business inquiries or bug reports and we\'ll reply as soon as we can.' => '联系 BrickAtlas。欢迎发送问题、商务合作或错误报告，我们会尽快回复。',
    'Track LEGO prices and find deals on sets: daily price drops, sets retiring soon, exclusive releases and minifigures on BrickAtlas.' => '追踪乐高价格，寻找优惠：每日降价、即将停产的套装、独家套装和人仔，尽在 BrickAtlas。',
    'Duplo and other toddler-safe sets for the smallest hands, with large pieces, simple shapes and lots of color.' => '适合小小手的得宝和其他幼儿套装，颗粒大、形状简单、色彩丰富。',
    'Sets for primary-school kids. Old enough for regular bricks, simple enough to finish in one sitting.' => '适合小学生的套装。用的是普通积木，又简单到可以一次拼完。',
    'Bigger, more detailed builds for ages 9 to 12, such as Star Wars vehicles, Friends towns and Ninjago dragons.' => '适合 9 至 12 岁的更大、更精细的模型，例如星球大战载具、好朋友小镇和幻影忍者神龙。',
    'Detailed sets with longer build times and proper display models. They work for teens and adults alike.' => '细节丰富、拼搭时间较长的套装和真正的展示模型，青少年和成人都适合。',
    'LEGO sets for builders 18 and up: Icons, Architecture, Botanical Collection, Technic supercars and other display models.' => '适合 18 岁以上拼搭者的乐高套装：Icons、建筑、植物收藏、机械组超跑等展示模型。',
    'Quick builds and pocket-money sets under 200 pieces. Good as small gifts, party favours or an impulse buy.' => '少于 200 颗粒的快拼模型和零花钱就能买的套装，适合当小礼物、派对伴手礼或随手购入。',
    'Big projects with thousands of pieces that take days to build: UCS Star Wars, Modular Buildings, Technic flagships and more.' => '需要好几天才能拼完的上千颗粒大型项目：UCS 星球大战、街景建筑、机械组旗舰等。',
    'Real-brick sets for primary-school kids that can be finished in one sitting.' => '适合小学生、可以一次拼完的普通积木套装。',
    'Quick builds under 200 pieces, good for gifts, party favours and impulse buys.' => '少于 200 颗粒的快拼模型，适合送礼、派对伴手礼和随手购入。',
    'Find the right set' => '找到合适的套装',
    'Browse LEGO mini-build sets that come with collectible magazines and compare prices for every magazine gift set.' => '随收藏杂志附赠的乐高迷你模型，可比较每款杂志赠品的价格。',
    'The 4 cm LEGO figure, introduced in 1978. You can swap heads, torsos and legs between figures.' => '高 4 厘米的乐高人仔，1978 年推出。头部、躯干和腿部可以在人仔之间互换。',
    'Browse LEGO sets tagged "{tag}" on BrickAtlas. Compare current prices across retailers and find related themes and exclusive releases.' => 'BrickAtlas 上带有“{tag}”标签的乐高套装。比较零售商的当前价格，找到相关主题和独家套装。',
    'Browse LEGO sets for kids aged 9 to 12. Compare prices on more advanced builds, popular themes and gift ideas on BrickAtlas.' => '适合 9 至 12 岁儿童的乐高套装。在 BrickAtlas 上比较进阶模型、热门主题和礼物灵感的价格。',
    'LEGO Sets Retiring Soon' => '即将停产的乐高套装',
    'LEGO Magazine Sets' => '乐高杂志套装',
    'LEGO Exclusive Sets' => '乐高独家套装',
    'Review' => '评价',
